<title>FRANCE: Rouen May 1-21 flour exports at 23,183 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen May 1-21 flour exports at 23,183 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen reached 23,183 tonnes between May 1 and May 21, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Flour exports for the whole of May 1996 were 34,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>May 1-21 exports included 750 tonnes to west Africa, 10,523 tonnes to Ethiopia and 11,910 tonnes to Libya, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
